WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song Of The Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 13]

01:43.450 --> 01:48.320
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

01:47.660 --> 01:48.820
Brother, sister-in-law,

01:48.820 --> 01:50.280
you are leaving tomorrow.

01:50.300 --> 01:51.060
Before you leave,

01:51.060 --> 01:52.500
we shall give you a toast.

01:52.979 --> 01:53.900
Later,

01:53.900 --> 01:56.340
you'll go to the Immortal Palace to observe the ceremony.

01:56.340 --> 01:57.670
Then we will meet again.

01:57.860 --> 01:58.530
Well...

01:58.820 --> 02:00.020
It will be in the Immortal Palace.

02:00.020 --> 02:01.890
But now, we can feel at ease here.

02:02.260 --> 02:03.100
Let's just

02:03.260 --> 02:04.260
have fun tonight.

02:04.940 --> 02:05.780
Cheers.

02:05.890 --> 02:06.950
-Cheers! -Cheers!

02:18.980 --> 02:22.250
[Sword Washing Pavilion]

02:38.500 --> 02:39.500
Lu Li.

02:43.380 --> 02:44.540
What are you doing?

02:46.500 --> 02:48.960
I'm looking at the moon on the willow branch.

02:52.329 --> 02:56.530
You should look at the willow branch [referring to Liu Shao] in front of you.

03:01.020 --> 03:01.660
Liu Shao.

03:02.340 --> 03:03.700
It's said there is a way

03:04.700 --> 03:06.220
that can help me stay with you forever.

03:06.220 --> 03:08.080
Then no one can separate us apart.

03:08.180 --> 03:10.040
Do you think I should give it a try?

03:10.810 --> 03:11.650
Try it.

03:12.740 --> 03:14.100
Of course you should.

03:19.500 --> 03:20.980
Maybe we can give it a try.

03:26.579 --> 03:27.610
But will it really

03:29.660 --> 03:31.920
be as simple as what my master described?

03:38.740 --> 03:41.860
The seal of the Four Seasons Tablet is getting weaker.

03:43.579 --> 03:45.940
I hope this disciple of Marquis Wuyang

03:46.460 --> 03:50.590
can really help the Immortal Palace get the Four Seasons Tablet restored.

04:09.780 --> 04:11.780
Aren't we going to the Immortal Palace?

04:11.780 --> 04:13.300
Why did you get a fish?

04:14.180 --> 04:14.910
Take a guess.

04:15.140 --> 04:16.940
Guess whether I'll guess or not.

04:18.300 --> 04:19.089
Do you know?

04:19.700 --> 04:20.579
It's said that

04:20.899 --> 04:22.250
mortals will be reborn

04:23.340 --> 04:25.220
as long as they enter the Immortal Palace,

04:25.220 --> 04:27.420
gaining unimaginably wonderful life.

04:38.100 --> 04:38.700
Come on.

04:44.580 --> 04:45.370
Be careful.

04:46.260 --> 04:46.920
Be careful.

04:48.860 --> 04:49.460
Get ready.

04:50.060 --> 04:51.980
Now is the real start.

05:51.900 --> 05:52.830
Look over there.

05:53.680 --> 05:55.820
[Immortal Palace]

06:16.260 --> 06:17.260
Immortal Master?

06:17.340 --> 06:18.540
I've seen you before.

06:19.020 --> 06:19.300
Nice to meet you, Immortal Master.

06:19.300 --> 06:20.100
Nice to meet you, Immortal Master Wanwu.

06:20.100 --> 06:20.660
That day,

06:21.060 --> 06:24.260
Marquis Wuyang asked me to look over the arrival of Immortal,

06:24.260 --> 06:25.940
I saw you two

06:26.500 --> 06:28.760
through the Mansion's Xuantian Mirror.

06:28.820 --> 06:29.900
So this time,

06:29.980 --> 06:31.820
was it you who gave me the chance?

06:33.180 --> 06:34.900
It was the Bone-Corroding Harp

06:34.900 --> 06:36.300
that gave you the chance.

06:40.220 --> 06:43.700
You are the new heir chosen by Marquis Wuyang?

06:45.130 --> 06:46.810
You're quite handsome.

06:49.659 --> 06:50.659
I feel flattered.

06:51.010 --> 06:54.020
I'm far from reaching Marquis Wuyang's cultivation.

06:57.780 --> 06:58.780
Immortal Master.

07:02.020 --> 07:02.660
It's you?

07:05.060 --> 07:05.660
What?

07:05.780 --> 07:06.980
You know them?

07:08.180 --> 07:08.780
Fine then,

07:09.580 --> 07:10.710
I'll leave these two

07:10.740 --> 07:11.700
to you.

07:13.490 --> 07:13.860
Okay.

07:13.980 --> 07:15.580
Take care, Immortal Master.

07:23.020 --> 07:24.480
Greetings, General. Xie.

07:27.140 --> 07:28.340
I have business to do.

07:29.020 --> 07:29.820
You two just

07:30.300 --> 07:32.100
go to Palace Wuji

07:32.220 --> 07:34.020
and settle down in the residence

07:34.820 --> 07:36.100
for low-rank disciples.

07:36.100 --> 07:36.830
Palace Wuji?

07:40.980 --> 07:41.540
General. Xie!

07:41.540 --> 07:43.020
Where is Palace Wuji?

07:44.060 --> 07:46.460
Where can we find it without you telling us?

07:46.870 --> 07:49.580
Don't worry. Since we're here, let's take it easy.

07:49.580 --> 07:50.110
Let's go.

07:50.460 --> 07:51.659
Let me show you around

07:52.340 --> 07:53.380
to get familiar with the environment.

07:53.380 --> 07:54.580
-Let's go. -Let's go.

07:56.580 --> 07:57.710
Let's go over there.

08:01.140 --> 08:03.340
Actually, I've been here when young.

08:04.020 --> 08:06.420
You've been to the Immortal Palace before?

08:10.900 --> 08:11.780
Look.

08:13.300 --> 08:15.960
This is the magic taught in the Immortal Palace?

08:20.020 --> 08:21.280
Look at their posture.

08:21.300 --> 08:22.430
Just like so, right?

08:24.020 --> 08:25.080
Do I look like them?

08:55.500 --> 08:56.460
Look.

08:56.650 --> 08:58.260
There are waterfalls in the sky?

08:58.260 --> 08:59.420
But you should have seen it before.

08:59.420 --> 09:01.260
I just took a look from afar.

09:02.660 --> 09:03.620
Lu Li.

09:04.980 --> 09:07.100
I wish this could last forever.

09:07.500 --> 09:09.830
Are you really going to stay here forever?

09:09.860 --> 09:10.820
I just want

09:11.770 --> 09:13.100
to be with you forever.

09:18.290 --> 09:20.420
I'm now under the Four Seasons Tablet.

09:21.340 --> 09:23.270
As long as I pull out the Moon Sword,

09:23.660 --> 09:25.320
I can be with Liu Shao forever.

09:27.700 --> 09:30.230
But Liu Shao was ordered to repair the Tablet.

09:31.420 --> 09:32.820
Should I tell this to her?

09:37.740 --> 09:38.450
Lu Li.

09:43.860 --> 09:45.190
Why are you spacing out?

09:45.660 --> 09:47.180
I went to wash some fruits just now.

09:47.180 --> 09:49.310
Have a taste to see whether it's sweet.

09:51.620 --> 09:52.280
Is it sweet?

09:56.660 --> 09:57.300
You too.

10:04.180 --> 10:06.140
I wonder what's the need of cultivating

10:06.140 --> 10:07.450
for these immortals.

10:07.860 --> 10:09.060
Our life now

10:09.060 --> 10:11.320
should be what immortals's life is like.

10:11.780 --> 10:13.100
They asked me to cultivate myself here.

10:13.100 --> 10:13.780
But...

10:13.900 --> 10:15.380
I've been here for so many days.

10:15.380 --> 10:17.300
They didn't give me any classes.

10:17.500 --> 10:18.500
Classes?

10:18.900 --> 10:20.690
They only want your Bone-Corroding Harp.

10:20.690 --> 10:22.620
As long as you help get the Four Seasons Tablet restored,

10:22.620 --> 10:24.480
they definitely will accept you.

10:25.730 --> 10:27.020
But if I fail to get it restored,

10:27.020 --> 10:28.420
will they drive me back?

10:30.340 --> 10:31.820
What are you thinking?

10:32.820 --> 10:33.620
You know what?

10:33.900 --> 10:35.180
They've prepared a lot

10:35.220 --> 10:37.150
to repair the Four Seasons Tablet.

10:37.260 --> 10:38.460
They just want to make use

10:38.460 --> 10:40.820
of the Bone-Corroding Harp's healing effect.

10:40.820 --> 10:41.540
If

10:42.820 --> 10:44.350
you fail to get it repaired,

10:44.460 --> 10:45.590
and ruin their plan,

10:46.530 --> 10:47.020
then...

10:47.370 --> 10:48.210
you will directly

10:48.210 --> 10:51.070
be thrown under the waterfall for feeding the fish.

10:55.180 --> 10:57.250
You've made the Immortal Palace described

10:57.250 --> 10:59.420
more terrifying than Ao Hen.

11:01.380 --> 11:02.620
It doesn't matter.

11:03.020 --> 11:05.380
Maybe I can get the Four Seasons Tablet restored.

11:05.380 --> 11:06.100
By then,

11:06.380 --> 11:07.330
I can beg them

11:07.380 --> 11:09.440
to let you stay here together with me.

11:12.340 --> 11:13.070
In that case,

11:13.940 --> 11:16.000
I would appreciate it a lot, Miss Liu.

11:16.900 --> 11:18.020
You're welcome.

11:23.380 --> 11:24.540
But you...

11:25.340 --> 11:27.690
you still have to take charge of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

11:27.690 --> 11:29.750
What if they don't allow me to go back?

11:31.620 --> 11:32.380
Boring.

11:37.860 --> 11:38.990
Let me show you this.

11:39.220 --> 11:40.140
What is this?

11:47.250 --> 11:47.910
Here you go.

11:57.020 --> 11:58.300
This is the magic doll?

11:58.900 --> 11:59.340
Yes.

12:00.100 --> 12:01.100
On the day when you drew the sword,

12:01.100 --> 12:02.960
Bai Feng used this to deceive you.

12:05.900 --> 12:08.050
Unfortunately, I don't have enough power.

12:08.050 --> 12:09.510
I can only conjure myself.

12:10.060 --> 12:11.100
But my master.

12:11.410 --> 12:12.580
can not only conjure me,

12:12.580 --> 12:13.620
but also...

12:14.420 --> 12:15.750
Don't be angry anymore.

12:16.940 --> 12:17.460
From now on, I'll never

12:17.460 --> 12:19.320
be cheated by these things again.

12:20.540 --> 12:22.260
I will believe you in the future.

12:22.260 --> 12:23.060
I only

12:23.780 --> 12:24.500
trust you,

12:28.300 --> 12:29.760
not what I see with my eyes,

12:30.220 --> 12:31.680
or what I hear with my ears.

12:33.620 --> 12:34.880
I'll only believe you.

12:48.780 --> 12:49.380
What?

12:50.380 --> 12:52.170
Are you here to laugh at me?

12:53.420 --> 12:55.820
I just want to laugh at the Immortal Palace.

12:56.140 --> 12:57.460
Are you interested?

12:57.700 --> 12:58.820
No.

12:59.820 --> 13:00.700
I just want to

13:01.300 --> 13:03.090
burn down the Immortal Palace

13:03.820 --> 13:05.620
and use all of their blood inside

13:05.620 --> 13:07.220
to worship my son, Ao Yin.

13:08.660 --> 13:09.860
Let's do it together.

13:10.580 --> 13:13.100
They're going to repair the Four Seasons Tablet tomorrow.

13:13.100 --> 13:14.860
We can watch the ceremony.

13:15.260 --> 13:16.130
Tomorrow?

13:17.460 --> 13:19.460
But there will be protection spells cast

13:19.460 --> 13:21.120
outside the Immortal Palace.

13:21.780 --> 13:23.220
Can you really get in?

13:50.180 --> 13:51.180
Where is Liu Shao?

13:52.740 --> 13:53.620
Liu Shao.

13:54.300 --> 13:55.900
You asked me out

13:56.060 --> 13:58.980
to talk about repairing the Four Seasons Tablet?

13:59.380 --> 14:00.340
No, no.

14:00.580 --> 14:03.440
I've treated myself with the Bone-Corroding Harp.

14:03.540 --> 14:04.940
I can feel its power.

14:05.140 --> 14:06.780
It won't go wrong.

14:07.020 --> 14:08.100
Then you are...

14:09.340 --> 14:10.420
It's about Lu Li.

14:10.980 --> 14:13.420
He had the Soul-Devouring Spell cast upon him.

14:13.420 --> 14:14.460
Although

14:14.460 --> 14:15.740
it's temporarily quelled,

14:15.740 --> 14:18.260
But this is not a long-term solution.

14:19.060 --> 14:20.380
So I want to say,

14:20.620 --> 14:22.500
if I can get the Four Seasons Tablet restored,

14:22.500 --> 14:24.430
can the Immortal Palace help

14:24.620 --> 14:27.130
remove the Soul-Devouring Spell from him?

14:27.860 --> 14:30.500
I can give up the chance to cultivate in the Immortal Palace.

14:30.500 --> 14:31.300
I only wish...

14:31.380 --> 14:33.310
for Lu Li's safety and well-being.

14:34.260 --> 14:35.180
Are you sure?

14:35.940 --> 14:37.000
Yes, I'm very sure.

14:37.380 --> 14:40.840
We'll talk about it after you restore the Four Seasons Tablet.

15:07.980 --> 15:09.380
Have you really decided?

15:10.140 --> 15:10.780
Of course.

15:12.020 --> 15:13.380
But mortals

15:13.570 --> 15:14.660
won't live long.

15:15.020 --> 15:16.620
I don't want

15:16.620 --> 15:18.740
to cultivate alone for thousands of years.

15:18.740 --> 15:20.460
I always wanted to go to the Immortal Palace

15:20.460 --> 15:21.720
and marry an immortal.

15:21.980 --> 15:22.900
But now,

15:23.060 --> 15:23.820
I have you.

15:25.060 --> 15:27.060
As long as I'm with you for this life,

15:27.380 --> 15:28.780
I don't think it's a loss.

15:29.740 --> 15:30.170
No.

15:30.460 --> 15:31.300
It will be my fortune.

15:31.300 --> 15:32.230
A great fortune.

15:33.700 --> 15:34.300
Okay.

15:34.570 --> 15:36.980
I'll ask Lord to be the matchmaker after we go back,

15:36.980 --> 15:38.710
and go propose marriage to you.

15:39.410 --> 15:40.980
Maybe there will be a lucky day for us

15:40.980 --> 15:43.220
to get married this year.

15:43.540 --> 15:44.140
By the way,

15:44.250 --> 15:45.380
when we get married,

15:45.820 --> 15:47.860
we should invite Wang Jian and Xue.

15:48.180 --> 15:49.060
And He Na.

15:52.460 --> 15:53.490
You're right.

15:54.220 --> 15:55.350
We can't forget him.

15:55.940 --> 15:56.850
Although

15:57.340 --> 15:59.600
I really don't like that fake fish demon.

16:08.100 --> 16:09.140
By then,

16:09.500 --> 16:11.980
we can build a house next to Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

16:11.980 --> 16:12.660
Yes.

16:12.860 --> 16:14.260
We need to raise a rabbit.

16:14.860 --> 16:15.380
Okay.

16:16.620 --> 16:17.650
And sheep.

16:32.130 --> 16:32.700
My Lord.

16:38.340 --> 16:38.900
Brother.

16:42.580 --> 16:43.580
This way, please.

17:27.060 --> 17:27.920
Today is the day

17:27.980 --> 17:29.340
for the Immortal Palace and the Mortal World

17:29.340 --> 17:30.980
to celebrate the grand event.

17:30.980 --> 17:32.420
A song to mend the heaven

17:32.580 --> 17:34.700
so that the friendship between immortals and mortals will be eternal.

17:34.700 --> 17:35.900
Rise!

17:57.300 --> 17:58.540
What a big scene!

18:13.180 --> 18:13.860
So,

18:14.220 --> 18:15.660
this is how the Immortal Palace

18:15.660 --> 18:17.060
protect the human world.

18:17.220 --> 18:18.020
Today,

18:18.340 --> 18:21.140
I will also become one to protect the mortal world.

18:21.540 --> 18:22.380
Liu Shao.

18:22.780 --> 18:24.420
Play the Bone-Corroding Harp

18:24.420 --> 18:26.420
to restore the Four Seasons Tablet.

18:26.420 --> 18:27.220
Concentrate.

18:27.820 --> 18:28.420
Calm down.

18:29.620 --> 18:30.880
Bone-Corroding Harp.

18:32.100 --> 18:32.700
Out.

19:39.820 --> 19:40.750
Look over there.

19:41.300 --> 19:42.780
The cracks are decreasing.

19:42.780 --> 19:43.130
Yes.

19:43.820 --> 19:44.940
It's getting restored.

19:44.940 --> 19:46.220
Senior Liu is amazing.

19:46.460 --> 19:47.100
Yes.

19:48.900 --> 19:50.220
As expected of Senior Liu Shao.

19:50.220 --> 19:51.880
My sister-in-law is amazing.

19:52.140 --> 19:53.210
Keep your voice down.

19:53.210 --> 19:54.810
What's the need of hiding it?

19:54.860 --> 19:56.540
My sister-in-law is indeed amazing.

19:56.540 --> 19:58.450
Even if my sister-in-law has become a disciple in the Immortal Palace,

19:58.450 --> 20:00.180
she's still my sister-in-law.

20:00.570 --> 20:01.300
Enough.

20:14.940 --> 20:16.340
The Bone-Corroding Harp

20:16.700 --> 20:18.300
seems to be calling someone.

20:50.140 --> 20:50.900
Liu Shao.

20:52.050 --> 20:55.740
Thank you for bringing the Bone-Corroding Harp to the Four Seasons Tablet.

20:55.740 --> 20:59.140
Now, it's my turn.

21:23.460 --> 21:24.190
This harp...

21:24.580 --> 21:26.540
It's stealing my vitality.

21:30.260 --> 21:30.740
No.

21:31.420 --> 21:31.980
No.

21:32.260 --> 21:33.060
Qiuxian.

21:33.060 --> 21:33.820
Lingqi.

21:34.300 --> 21:35.620
Steady the formation.

21:35.620 --> 21:36.500
What's happening?

21:36.500 --> 21:37.430
What's going on?

21:49.980 --> 21:50.740
Stop!

21:51.900 --> 21:53.020
Stop!

22:05.740 --> 22:06.540
Immortal Master.

22:06.540 --> 22:08.340
Look at the Four Seasons Tablet.

22:08.540 --> 22:09.380
Immortal Master.

22:09.380 --> 22:10.580
We can't suppress it.

22:13.660 --> 22:14.660
What should we do?

22:15.220 --> 22:17.420
I can't control the Bone-Corroding Harp.

22:17.420 --> 22:18.780
What's wrong with Liu Shao?

22:18.780 --> 22:20.740
Is she going to destroy the Four Seasons Tablet?

22:20.740 --> 22:22.380
Liu Shao, what are you doing?

22:24.050 --> 22:25.060
Do your best.

22:25.380 --> 22:27.100
Don't let that devil come out.

22:27.210 --> 22:28.470
Change the formation!

22:35.340 --> 22:36.740
It seems that the Bone-Corroding Harp

22:36.740 --> 22:38.340
is out of Liu Shao's control.

23:15.820 --> 23:16.460
Liu Shao!

23:33.610 --> 23:34.220
Liu Shao!

23:48.500 --> 23:49.180
No!

23:49.180 --> 23:50.700
A demon's attacking the Zijin Shield.

23:50.700 --> 23:53.160
It's trying to break the protection spells.

23:53.460 --> 23:53.940
Oh, no.

23:54.140 --> 23:56.000
Sister-in-law is still up there.

23:59.060 --> 24:00.320
Lay out the formation!

24:44.020 --> 24:46.090
Disciples of Marquis Wuyang, listen up.

24:46.090 --> 24:47.380
Protect the Four Seasons Tablet!

24:47.380 --> 24:48.140
Yes.

25:12.380 --> 25:13.410
Xie Lingqi.

25:14.100 --> 25:16.160
Pay with your life for my son's death.

25:57.060 --> 25:58.720
You overestimated yourself.

25:59.620 --> 26:02.420
Let me see who else can stop me.

26:07.900 --> 26:08.660
My Lord.

26:12.900 --> 26:13.860
Marquis Wuyang.

26:19.700 --> 26:20.340
My Lord.

26:26.220 --> 26:28.460
Bone-Corroding Harp! No!

26:32.700 --> 26:34.030
Soul-Devouring Spell?

26:34.340 --> 26:36.540
Why would it break out at this moment?

26:44.620 --> 26:46.780
Liu Shao, no.

26:48.420 --> 26:50.140
I can't hold on anymore.

26:59.060 --> 27:00.180
Liu Shao.

27:01.980 --> 27:03.690
Is this what's called

27:04.300 --> 27:06.580
having no choice...

27:10.060 --> 27:10.900
Lu Li.

27:11.740 --> 27:13.000
Did you see it clearly?

27:14.410 --> 27:15.580
Your beloved one,

27:16.900 --> 27:17.860
your friends,

27:18.940 --> 27:20.060
and your fellows

27:21.500 --> 27:22.260
are dying.

27:24.580 --> 27:27.440
When the Soul-Devouring Spell is fully triggered,

27:27.580 --> 27:29.140
you will die soon.

27:33.420 --> 27:34.480
Are you satisfied?

27:43.260 --> 27:44.780
Pick up the Moon Sword,

27:44.780 --> 27:46.440
break the Four Seasons Tablet

27:46.570 --> 27:48.380
and revive God of the Moonlight.

27:54.660 --> 27:57.140
As long as you have the power of God,

27:57.460 --> 27:59.260
all spirits in the Three Realms

27:59.500 --> 28:01.490
will follow your order.

28:01.820 --> 28:02.540
Everything

28:03.060 --> 28:05.380
will be under your control.

28:06.060 --> 28:06.620
Lu Li.

28:08.300 --> 28:10.030
If you want to protect Liu Shao,

28:11.020 --> 28:13.080
go and break the Four Seasons Tablet.

28:14.860 --> 28:16.660
To break the Four Seasons Tablet

28:16.860 --> 28:20.100
can get them saved.

28:26.740 --> 28:27.620
Lu Li!

28:28.420 --> 28:30.280
Protect the Four Seasons Tablet!

28:30.490 --> 28:32.100
Once it's destroyed,

28:33.340 --> 28:35.300
and the devil comes out,

28:35.660 --> 28:37.460
the Three Realms will be in hell.

28:37.860 --> 28:39.900
All spirits will suffer.

28:44.260 --> 28:45.980
All spirits will suffer...

28:47.100 --> 28:48.740
Everything will be in hell.

28:51.140 --> 28:52.800
Break the Four Seasons Tablet

28:53.060 --> 28:54.650
to get the power of God

28:54.900 --> 28:56.830
so that you can truly protect them.

28:58.340 --> 28:59.380
Lu Li.

28:59.380 --> 29:01.020
What are you waiting for?

29:03.220 --> 29:04.290
Lu Li.

29:04.290 --> 29:05.860
Why are you hesitating?

29:06.410 --> 29:08.220
Look at your dead fellows.

29:09.940 --> 29:12.380
Your current power can't save anyone.

29:12.660 --> 29:13.940
Get up!

29:13.940 --> 29:16.340
Help them protect the Four Seasons Tablet!

29:17.500 --> 29:19.230
Break the Four Seasons Tablet.

29:20.900 --> 29:22.740
I won't break the Four Seasons Tablet.

29:22.740 --> 29:24.470
To revive God of the Moonlight,

29:25.140 --> 29:27.070
will make the Three Realms suffer.

29:28.380 --> 29:29.710
I won't let that happen.

29:29.780 --> 29:33.620
I won't!

29:45.780 --> 29:46.660
Lu Li.

29:47.460 --> 29:49.540
Don't disappoint me.

29:50.700 --> 29:51.740
The future

29:52.500 --> 29:54.060
is on you.

29:56.180 --> 29:57.020
Ridiculous.

29:57.740 --> 29:59.740
Let me see what you can do now.

29:59.980 --> 30:00.940
Damn.

30:03.540 --> 30:05.900
I've protected the world for my whole life.

30:05.900 --> 30:07.430
Even if I have to sacrifice,

30:07.460 --> 30:10.380
I won't allow you to tread on it.

30:21.980 --> 30:22.820
My Lord!

30:40.620 --> 30:41.620
My Lord!

30:43.660 --> 30:44.380
No.

30:45.100 --> 30:48.060
I can't be restrained by the Bone-Corroding Harp anymore.

30:48.060 --> 30:50.410
I'm the one who plays the Harp.

30:55.250 --> 30:56.860
I am.

31:11.340 --> 31:11.900
Liu Shao!

31:13.420 --> 31:13.950
Liu Shao!

31:17.420 --> 31:18.020
Liu Shao!

31:21.090 --> 31:22.260
Lu Li!

31:44.180 --> 31:44.980
Lu Li.

31:45.300 --> 31:48.430
I wanted to heal my injury with Liu Shao's divine spirit.

31:48.660 --> 31:49.860
But

31:50.180 --> 31:52.220
you've come here to die first.

31:58.620 --> 31:59.300
Lu Li!

32:01.260 --> 32:02.180
Lu Li!

32:15.700 --> 32:18.260
You humble mortals...

32:18.740 --> 32:21.340
You only deserve to be my son's burial objects.

32:25.860 --> 32:27.050
In the end,

32:29.020 --> 32:30.140
I still can't

32:32.340 --> 32:34.660
protect the ones I want to protect?

32:39.500 --> 32:40.380
Lu Li.

32:54.220 --> 32:57.220
Why should mortals die just because they're mortals?

32:57.530 --> 33:00.060
Mortals also have things they want to defend,

33:01.580 --> 33:03.260
and people they want to protect.

33:03.260 --> 33:04.300
Lu Li.

33:39.020 --> 33:40.300
The Moon Sword!

33:41.340 --> 33:44.200
How can the Moon Sword regard a mortal as its master?

33:44.500 --> 33:46.820
Do you remember what I said when we met?

33:47.530 --> 33:49.260
Even if I'm not the most powerful one,

33:49.260 --> 33:50.660
I dare to fight against everything,

33:50.660 --> 33:53.120
no matter how strong or weak the opponent is.

34:03.900 --> 34:04.860
No!

34:23.540 --> 34:24.420
To be a God

34:25.739 --> 34:28.260
by sacrificing my friends and my beloved one.

34:28.260 --> 34:29.179
I won't do that.

34:29.900 --> 34:31.230
I just want to be a mortal

34:31.900 --> 34:34.300
to fight alongside them.

35:33.660 --> 35:34.500
Impossible.

35:48.340 --> 35:48.970
Xue.

35:49.340 --> 35:49.860
How are you?

35:49.860 --> 35:50.650
Are you okay?

35:50.820 --> 35:51.550
Are you okay?

35:52.820 --> 35:53.950
Are you really okay?

35:54.410 --> 35:55.140
I'm fine.

36:01.620 --> 36:02.220
Slow down.

36:18.370 --> 36:19.180
Brother.

36:28.020 --> 36:28.820
Brother!

36:29.140 --> 36:30.020
Lu Li!

36:30.020 --> 36:30.550
Brother.

36:31.340 --> 36:32.220
Lu Li!

36:32.450 --> 36:33.220
Brother!

36:33.980 --> 36:34.860
Lu Li.

36:36.340 --> 36:37.100
No.

36:38.900 --> 36:39.620
Liu Shao.

36:42.180 --> 36:44.440
I've promised you to be with you forever.

36:44.660 --> 36:45.180
I...

36:48.300 --> 36:49.980
I may be not able to make it.

36:50.530 --> 36:51.780
No.

36:52.260 --> 36:53.940
You've promised me.

36:54.140 --> 36:55.220
You've promised me.

36:55.220 --> 36:56.900
Don't lie to me.

37:00.940 --> 37:02.060
I said

37:03.130 --> 37:04.930
I would take care of you forever.

37:08.300 --> 37:09.540
Unfortunately,

37:12.700 --> 37:14.100
I still can't

37:17.100 --> 37:18.380
protect you anymore.

37:20.620 --> 37:22.500
I don't want you to protect me.

37:22.780 --> 37:24.540
I only want you to be fine.

37:25.380 --> 37:27.340
I just want you to be fine.

37:27.860 --> 37:30.100
Your safety is more important than anything.

37:30.100 --> 37:32.260
Promise me. Please.

37:32.970 --> 37:34.300
-You must be fine. -Stop crying.

37:34.300 --> 37:35.340
Don't cry.

37:36.420 --> 37:37.980
Please.

37:38.580 --> 37:41.020
Please.

37:54.340 --> 37:55.420
We...

37:56.100 --> 37:57.430
See you in the next life.

37:58.460 --> 37:59.820
No.

38:00.540 --> 38:02.620
We promised to be good.

38:03.010 --> 38:05.180
We agreed to be together forever.

38:06.460 --> 38:08.220
Lu Li, I beg you.

38:08.500 --> 38:09.820
Don't leave me.

38:10.220 --> 38:11.340
Please.

38:11.780 --> 38:12.820
In this life,

38:15.980 --> 38:17.340
I feel lucky to meet you.

38:19.940 --> 38:22.200
Sorry for failing to be with you forever.

38:28.100 --> 38:29.770
But I never regret meeting you.

38:29.770 --> 38:32.340
♫This is a spring song♫

38:33.510 --> 38:35.980
♫The peach blossoms fly with the swallow♫

38:37.080 --> 38:42.180
♫Whose lights are light and shine people's way home?♫

38:44.420 --> 38:47.100
♫The clouds roll the sunset♫

38:48.180 --> 38:50.640
♫The moon kisses the eyebrows♫

38:50.640 --> 38:52.870
♫I am waiting for you to say♫

38:52.870 --> 38:56.890
♫Tonight in this life♫

38:57.780 --> 39:01.700
♫Ask the flowing water whether it knows the red leaves♫

39:01.700 --> 39:05.280
♫I miss you so much♫

39:05.280 --> 39:07.760
♫I still remember the youth♫

39:08.510 --> 39:11.860
♫I laughed and hated getting old♫

39:12.640 --> 39:15.460
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

39:12.980 --> 39:15.380
Actually I've long discovered that my life

39:15.460 --> 39:17.390
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

39:15.540 --> 39:16.940
is in the hands of others.

39:17.750 --> 39:20.070
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

39:19.020 --> 39:19.940
In this world

39:20.070 --> 39:22.890
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

39:20.460 --> 39:21.520
I've gone through,

39:22.410 --> 39:23.220
I was just like a shadow,

39:23.220 --> 39:24.420
without leaving anything behind.

39:23.220 --> 39:26.360
♫Send you to the Western State♫

39:27.500 --> 39:28.820
But I met you.

39:27.500 --> 39:30.260
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

39:30.260 --> 39:32.560
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

39:31.740 --> 39:32.820
Lu Li.

39:32.560 --> 39:34.790
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

39:33.020 --> 39:35.580
Your words may be a little bit harsh.

39:34.790 --> 39:35.810
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

39:35.810 --> 39:41.670
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫

39:36.300 --> 39:37.180
But

39:37.620 --> 39:39.220
when everyone suspected me,

39:39.740 --> 39:42.340
only you would trust me and help me.

39:55.580 --> 39:56.380
30,000 taels?

39:59.660 --> 40:00.380
Awesome!

40:11.790 --> 40:15.710
♫Ask the flowing water whether it knows the red leaves♫

40:14.620 --> 40:15.620
Then I...

40:15.710 --> 40:19.290
♫I miss you so much♫

40:15.740 --> 40:17.500
I'll ask Lord to be the matchmaker after we go back.

40:17.500 --> 40:19.180
Maybe there will be a lucky day for us

40:19.180 --> 40:20.940
to get married this year.

40:19.290 --> 40:21.770
♫I still remember the youth♫

40:20.940 --> 40:22.020
Liu Shao!

40:22.520 --> 40:25.870
♫I laughed and hated getting old♫

40:23.180 --> 40:24.260
-Lu Li! -Liu Shao!

40:24.580 --> 40:26.300
Lu Li!

40:28.290 --> 40:31.110
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

40:31.110 --> 40:33.050
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

40:33.400 --> 40:35.720
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

40:35.720 --> 40:38.540
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

40:36.900 --> 40:38.260
Then set a time limit.

40:38.620 --> 40:39.500
Make it last...

40:38.870 --> 40:42.010
♫Send you to the Western State♫

40:41.010 --> 40:43.150
to the moment when I can't protect my beloved one,

40:43.150 --> 40:45.910
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

40:43.420 --> 40:44.820
no more needed by anyone,

40:45.460 --> 40:46.980
and come to the end of my life.

40:45.910 --> 40:48.210
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

40:47.540 --> 40:50.180
Lu Li.

40:48.210 --> 40:50.440
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

40:50.440 --> 40:51.460
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

40:51.460 --> 40:57.320
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫

40:53.060 --> 40:54.780
I was born with only half a heart.

40:54.780 --> 40:55.620
Now,

40:56.060 --> 40:57.610
I've found the other half.

40:59.690 --> 41:00.540
It's you.

42:04.600 --> 42:05.330
Liar!

44:05.420 --> 44:06.860
Let's catch the moon!

44:07.020 --> 44:09.100
Don't miss it.

44:09.210 --> 44:10.100
Miss.

44:10.660 --> 44:11.820
Miss.

44:13.340 --> 44:15.620
I said it's true, but you don't believe me.

44:15.620 --> 44:17.020
I've been here before.

44:17.020 --> 44:18.540
The immortal brought me here.

44:18.540 --> 44:19.220
Miss.

44:19.220 --> 44:20.980
Miss, slow down.

44:21.180 --> 44:21.980
Miss.

44:22.100 --> 44:23.340
So cute.

44:24.620 --> 44:26.380
When I find my immortal,

44:26.780 --> 44:28.660
I will ask him to take me to see

44:28.660 --> 44:31.590
mountains, the sun, the moon, and stars everywhere.

44:32.640 --> 44:34.260
To catch the moon!

44:34.610 --> 44:36.930
Don't miss it.

44:37.300 --> 44:39.100
Let's catch the moon.

44:44.500 --> 44:46.140
I've once thought about

44:47.120 --> 44:48.360
whether the promise

44:48.850 --> 44:50.540
was just a dream or not.

44:52.010 --> 44:55.460
Because I can't remember his face.

44:56.630 --> 44:58.490
If you leave your fate in my hands,

44:59.660 --> 45:01.520
I can play with you for three days.

45:02.510 --> 45:03.770
We can go to

45:04.480 --> 45:05.680
the most interesting

45:06.370 --> 45:08.470
and funnest places all over the world.

45:08.470 --> 45:10.270
But if I don't believe in myself,

45:10.950 --> 45:12.010
then the three days

45:12.510 --> 45:13.850
can only be a dream.

45:15.320 --> 45:16.580
Only by believing it

45:18.090 --> 45:18.950
can the promise

45:20.490 --> 45:21.410
be real.

45:37.080 --> 45:38.000
Immortal?
